title: The Reproductive-Rights Settlement
subtitle: Begin with a Canadian-model bill; compromise only when a veto player forces it down.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_major_reform_card
frequency: 135
view-if: month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_abortion_reform_timer <= 0 and abortion_reform_settled = 0 and reform_pressure_pending = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.poland_abortion_reform_timer = 3;
Q.abortion_reform_next_stage = Number(Q.abortion_reform_proposal_stage) || 4;
const abortionThresholds = [0, 28, 43, 62, 82];
Q.abortion_reform_threshold =
    abortionThresholds[Q.abortion_reform_next_stage];
const ministryBonus =
    (Q.equality_minister_party == "Lewica" ? 9 : 0) +
    (Q.health_minister_party == "Lewica" ? 7 : 0) +
    (Q.justice_minister_party == "Lewica" ? 4 : 0);
const koCabinet = Q.government_party == "ko" || Q.ministry_ko_in_cabinet;
const pslCabinet = Q.government_party == "psl" || Q.ministry_psl_in_cabinet;
const p2050Cabinet =
    Q.government_party == "p2050" || Q.ministry_p2050_in_cabinet;
const thirdWayCabinet = pslCabinet || p2050Cabinet;
const thirdWayRelation = pslCabinet && p2050Cabinet
    ? Math.min(Number(Q.psl_relation), Number(Q.p2050_relation))
    : (pslCabinet ? Number(Q.psl_relation) : Number(Q.p2050_relation));
let partnerBonus = 0;
if (Q.government_party == "pis") {
    partnerBonus =
        Number(Q.pis_relation) * 0.16 +
        Number(Q.pis_accept_rights) * 0.12 +
        Number(Q.abortion_pis_commitment) * 7 +
        Number(Q.pis_solidarist_share) * 0.05 -
        Number(Q.pis_market_hardliner_share) * 0.03;
    if (
        Q.left_in_government &&
        Q.president_name == "Rafał Trzaskowski"
    ) {
        partnerBonus += 9;
    }
} else {
    partnerBonus =
        (koCabinet
            ? Number(Q.ko_relation) * 0.10 +
                Number(Q.ko_accept_rights) * 0.12 +
                Number(Q.abortion_ko_commitment) * 6
            : 0) +
        (thirdWayCabinet
            ? Number(Q.abortion_third_way_commitment) * 5 -
                Math.max(0, 48 - thirdWayRelation) * 0.18 -
                (pslCabinet ? Number(Q.psl_conservative_share) * 0.04 : 0)
            : 0) +
        (Q.abortion_reform_next_stage <= 2
            ? Number(Q.abortion_pis_commitment) * 3 +
                Math.max(0, Number(Q.pis_relation) - 50) * 0.04
            : 0);
}
const palaceBonus =
    Number(Q.president_relation) * 0.08 +
    (Q.abortion_palace_president == Q.president_name
        ? Number(Q.abortion_palace_commitment) * 6
        : 0) +
    (Q.president_name == "Rafał Trzaskowski" ? 7 : 0) +
    (Q.trz_abortion_signature ? 8 : 0);
const publicBonus =
    (Number(Q.abortion_rights_support) - 40) * 0.35 +
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.left_poll) - 5) * 0.55 -
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.abortion_rights_backlash) - 55) * 0.12;
Q.abortion_reform_power = Math.round(Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        140,
        Number(Q.abortion_reform_progress) * 0.62 +
        partnerBonus + palaceBonus + publicBonus + ministryBonus +
        (Q.abortion_referendum_mandate ? 18 : 0) -
        Number(Q.eu_progressive_headwind)
    )
));
!}
card-image: img/poland/cards/equality-bill.webp

= Reproductive rights as a whole-game project

**Campaign goal:** [? if abortion_reform_defined: [+
abortion_reform_goal_label +].?][? if not abortion_reform_defined: Not yet
defined.?]
[? if abortion_reform_defined: **Bill currently on the table:** [+
abortion_reform_next_label +].
**Passage power:** **[+ abortion_reform_power +]**; this bill needs **[+
abortion_reform_threshold +]**.?][? if not abortion_reform_defined: The first
project action must define the ambitious bill before preparation or bargaining
can begin.?]

The four numbered outcomes are fallback settlements, not steps to fill in.
Lewica begins at the Canadian model. If resistance knocks the bill down and a
lesser version passes, that settlement closes this campaign.

[? if eu_progressive_headwind > 0: Europe's rightward shift removes **[+
eu_progressive_headwind +] passage power** from this progressive reform. EU
social and democratic organising can reduce that headwind; it cannot replace
a Polish majority.?]

[? if left_in_government: A cabinet seat lets Lewica table the bill. It does
not erase KO's conservatives, PSL's conscience clause, PiS's culture-war wing
or the President.?][? if not left_in_government: We cannot enact a statute
from opposition. We can make the draft, public mandate and private promises
survive until the next coalition negotiation.?]

[? if equality_minister_party = "Lewica" or health_minister_party = "Lewica"
or justice_minister_party = "Lewica": A Lewica-held Equality, Health or Justice
portfolio turns promises into clauses and lowers the practical price of the
next vote.?][? if abortion_referendum_mandate: A successful referendum
campaign supplies an explicit public mandate. Coalition parties and the Palace
can still resist, but they now pay for doing so.?]

- @define_goal
- @draft
- @coalition_round
- @cash_relation
- @palace
- @referendum
- @advance

@define_goal
title: Define the goal as Canadian-model decriminalisation
subtitle: The opening mandate is maximal; narrow decriminalisation compromises are fallback positions, not prerequisites.
view-if: abortion_reform_defined = 0
on-arrival: abortion_reform_defined = 1; abortion_reform_goal_stage = 4; abortion_reform_proposal_stage = 4; abortion_reform_next_stage = 4; abortion_reform_progress += 12; feminist_trust += 3; progressive_credibility += 2; news_headline = "Lewica defines Canadian-model decriminalisation as its reproductive-rights bill"

The campaign now has an endpoint against which every negotiation can be
measured. No one can rebrand the closest available compromise as the original
programme.

- #poland_card_finish

@draft
title: Keep the clinical and legal team working
subtitle: Free. Preparation +10; no party promises a vote yet.
view-if: abortion_reform_defined = 1
on-arrival: abortion_reform_progress += 10; feminist_trust += 1; news_headline = "Lewica keeps the reproductive-rights statute ready for the next opening"

Patients, clinicians and criminal lawyers reconcile the bill with the cases
that a slogan usually omits. The next negotiation begins with text rather than
another declaration of intent.

- #poland_card_finish

@coalition_round
title: Put concessions on a possible coalition partner's table
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Choose KO, [+ third_way_display_name +] or PiS and record one promise.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: A serious negotiating round needs one resource.
view-if: abortion_reform_defined = 1
new-page: true

Before power, this sets expectations for coalition talks. In government, it
turns a general relationship into an issue-specific promise.

- @round_ko
- @round_third_way
- @round_pis

@round_ko
title: Ask KO to record a reproductive-rights floor
on-arrival: resources -= 1; abortion_reform_progress += 8; abortion_ko_commitment += 1; ko_relation += 4; news_headline = "KO records an abortion-law floor for the next coalition agreement"

- #poland_card_finish

@round_third_way
title: Make [+ third_way_display_name +] name a compromise it would permit
view-if: p2050_emerged = 1 or third_way_active = 1
on-arrival: {! resources -= 1; abortion_reform_progress += 8; abortion_third_way_commitment += 1; psl_relation += 3; p2050_relation += 3; Q.news_headline = Q.third_way_display_name + " records a limited abortion-law compromise"; !}

- #poland_card_finish

@round_pis
title: Open a limited decriminalisation channel with PiS
choose-if: (left_in_government = 1 and government_party = "pis") or pis_relation >= 15 or pis_negotiation_hostility_relief >= 5 or national_crisis_pressure >= 25
unavailable-subtitle: PiS will not record a rights promise without coalition ties, an established channel or national pressure.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; abortion_reform_progress += 8; abortion_pis_commitment += 1; pis_relation += 4; pis_solidarist_share += 1; news_headline = "PiS records a limited reproductive-rights channel"

- #poland_card_finish

@cash_relation
title: Cash in a party relationship instead of spending a resource
subtitle: Choose a 58+ relationship; it falls by 12 and becomes one recorded promise.
choose-if: ko_relation >= 58 or pis_relation >= 58 or ((p2050_emerged = 1 or third_way_active = 1) and (psl_relation >= 58 or p2050_relation >= 58))
unavailable-subtitle: No potential governing partner trusts us enough yet.
view-if: abortion_reform_defined = 1
new-page: true

- @cash_ko
- @cash_third_way
- @cash_pis

@cash_ko
title: Spend KO goodwill on reproductive rights
choose-if: ko_relation >= 58
on-arrival: ko_relation -= 12; abortion_ko_commitment += 1; abortion_reform_progress += 10; news_headline = "Lewica converts KO goodwill into an abortion-law promise"

- #poland_card_finish

@cash_third_way
title: Spend [+ third_way_display_name +] goodwill on a limited compromise
view-if: p2050_emerged = 1 or third_way_active = 1
choose-if: psl_relation >= 58 or p2050_relation >= 58
on-arrival: {!
if (Number(Q.psl_relation) >= Number(Q.p2050_relation)) {
    Q.psl_relation -= 12;
} else {
    Q.p2050_relation -= 12;
}
Q.abortion_third_way_commitment += 1;
Q.abortion_reform_progress += 10;
Q.news_headline = "Lewica converts " + Q.third_way_display_name + " goodwill into an abortion compromise";
!}

- #poland_card_finish

@cash_pis
title: Spend PiS goodwill on limited decriminalisation
choose-if: pis_relation >= 58
on-arrival: pis_relation -= 12; abortion_pis_commitment += 1; abortion_reform_progress += 10; news_headline = "Lewica converts PiS goodwill into a limited abortion-law promise"

- #poland_card_finish

@palace
title: Put clinicians and constitutional lawyers before the President
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Build a presidential commitment and preparation.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The Palace delegation needs one resource.
view-if: abortion_reform_defined = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
if (Q.abortion_palace_president != Q.president_name) {
    Q.abortion_palace_commitment = 0;
    Q.abortion_palace_president = Q.president_name;
}
Q.abortion_palace_commitment += 1;
Q.abortion_reform_progress += 6;
Q.president_relation += 3;
Q.news_headline = "The President receives the reproductive-rights implementation file";
!}

[? if president_name = "Andrzej Duda": Duda's office is more willing to discuss
criminal exposure and medical emergencies than a full access model. That
limited channel can still become the difference between a law and a veto.?]
[? if president_name = "Rafał Trzaskowski": Trzaskowski's political sympathy
shortens the meeting; the file still makes his signature operational rather
than symbolic.?]
[? if president_name != "Andrzej Duda" and president_name != "Rafał Trzaskowski":
The Palace now owns a written account of what assent, veto or referral would
do to patients and clinicians.?]

- #poland_card_finish

@referendum
title: Ask the country for an explicit reproductive-rights mandate
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Hard referendum route; preparation, public support and Left polling all count.
choose-if: left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and resources >= 1 and abortion_reform_progress >= 30 and abortion_rights_support >= 50 and abortion_referendum_mandate = 0
unavailable-subtitle: Requires governing authority, one resource, 30 preparation and majority public support.
view-if: abortion_reform_defined = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
const referendumVariation =
    Math.floor((this.random.uint32() / 4294967296) * 11) - 5;
Q.abortion_referendum_score = Math.round(
    18 + Number(Q.abortion_rights_support) * 0.45 +
    Number(Q.left_poll) * 0.50 +
    Number(Q.abortion_reform_progress) * 0.15 -
    Number(Q.abortion_rights_backlash) * 0.18 +
    (Number(Q.abortion_ko_commitment) +
        Number(Q.abortion_pis_commitment) +
        Number(Q.abortion_third_way_commitment)) * 2 +
    referendumVariation
);
if (Q.abortion_referendum_score >= 50) {
    Q.abortion_referendum_mandate = 1;
    Q.abortion_reform_progress += 12;
    Q.feminist_trust += 6;
    Q.public_trust += 2;
    Q.abortion_referendum_result = "A majority endorsed the reform mandate";
    Q.news_headline = "A national vote gives reproductive-rights reform a public mandate";
} else {
    Q.abortion_reform_progress = Math.max(
        Number(Q.abortion_reform_stage) * 20,
        Number(Q.abortion_reform_progress) - 8
    );
    Q.abortion_reform_proposal_stage =
        Number(Q.abortion_reform_goal_stage) || 4;
    Q.poland_abortion_reform_timer = 6;
    Q.feminist_trust -= 2;
    Q.public_trust -= 2;
    Q.abortion_rights_backlash += 6;
    Q.abortion_referendum_result = "The reform mandate fell short";
    Q.news_headline = "The reproductive-rights referendum campaign falls short";
}
!}
go-to: referendum_result

@referendum_result
title: The referendum count
new-page: true

**Campaign score: [+ abortion_referendum_score +].** [+
abortion_referendum_result +].

[? if abortion_referendum_mandate: A referendum is a mandate, not a magic
statute. Lewica must still put clauses through the Sejm and onto the
President's desk, but PSL can no longer call delay the only democratic route.?]
[? if not abortion_referendum_mandate: The defeat strengthens every veto
player and forces a six-month regroup. The ambitious goal and drafting work
survive, and this project card can return after the cooldown for another
attempt.?]

- #poland_card_finish

@advance
title: Table the bill: [+ abortion_reform_next_label +]
subtitle: Requires government and passage power at or above the displayed threshold; resistance may force a narrower final settlement.
view-if: abortion_reform_defined = 1
choose-if: left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and abortion_reform_power >= abortion_reform_threshold
unavailable-subtitle: We either lack executive access or have not assembled enough coalition, public and presidential power.
on-arrival: reform_pressure_issue = "abortion"; reform_pressure_target_stage = abortion_reform_proposal_stage; reform_pressure_previous_stage = 0; reform_pressure_return_mode = "card"; reform_pressure_palace_override = 0; reform_pressure_referendum_used = 0
go-to: poland_major_reforms.resolve
